# Local environments, caches and generated build products
/.venv/
/.dev/
/_待清理开发冗余/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.runtimeconfig.json
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
*.zip
*.nupkg
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
/.vs/
